<svg viewBox="0 0 720 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="The data processing pipeline">
  <defs>
    <marker id="ch08pr-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--ink-faint)" />
    </marker>
  </defs>

  <rect x="40" y="20" width="640" height="74" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
  <text x="64" y="46" font-size="13" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">1 · Inspect — stare at your data (15 minutes saves hours)</text>
  <text x="64" y="66" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">plot token/length/topic distributions by source, time, annotator · spot outliers · compute inter-annotator</text>
  <text x="64" y="82" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">disagreement · annotate a few examples yourself and compare · fact-check responses</text>

  <line x1="360" y1="94" x2="360" y2="116" stroke="var(--ink-faint)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#ch08pr-arrow)" />

  <rect x="40" y="122" width="640" height="74" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
  <text x="64" y="148" font-size="13" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">2 · Deduplicate — duplicates skew distributions and contaminate test splits</text>
  <text x="64" y="168" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">repeating 0.1% of data 100× degraded an 800M model to 400M level · whole-/intra-/cross-doc duplication</text>
  <text x="64" y="184" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">methods: pairwise similarity (small data) · hashing (MinHash, Bloom filter) · dimensionality reduction + comparison</text>

  <line x1="360" y1="196" x2="360" y2="218" stroke="var(--ink-faint)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#ch08pr-arrow)" />

  <rect x="40" y="224" width="640" height="74" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
  <text x="64" y="250" font-size="13" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">3 · Clean &amp; filter — formatting junk, compliance, low quality</text>
  <text x="64" y="270" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">strip HTML/Markdown noise (one team: +20% accuracy, −60% input tokens) · remove PII / toxic / non-compliant fields</text>
  <text x="64" y="286" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">heuristics from inspection (late-session annotations are worse) · active learning / importance sampling</text>

  <line x1="360" y1="298" x2="360" y2="320" stroke="var(--ink-faint)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#ch08pr-arrow)" />

  <rect x="40" y="326" width="640" height="50" rx="10" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" />
  <text x="64" y="348" font-size="13" font-weight="550" fill="var(--accent-ink)">4 · Format — the model's tokenizer + chat template, exactly</text>
  <text x="64" y="366" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">finetuning prompts drop task descriptions · serving must match training format (“burger --&gt;” ≠ “burger”)</text>
</svg>
